    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "elder-gu-room",
      "text": "Moonlight Gu. Every Gu Yue student takes it first, and most of them take nothing else.",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "A translucent pale-blue crescent, cold as jade against the palm.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The clan owns the breeding method. That is why it is the signature, and not because of the poetry.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "elder-gu-room",
      "text": "It eats moon orchid petals. Every six days, and it is your business to remember.",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "flag",
      "set": "codex.upkeep"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "So the first thing I learn about my first Gu is what it costs to keep.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
